BEGIN:VEVENT
ATTENDEE;CN="Daniel Kai Kwong HO";RSVP=TRUE:mailto:danielhokk@dbs.com
ATTENDEE;CN="Susanna LAM";RSVP=TRUE:mailto:susannalam@dbs.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230619T103540Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nDBS Career Jam (Hong Kong)\nSynopsis\n:\nDo you have 
	questions on internal mobility? Join us as we hear from employees who have
	 done internal mobility\, hiring managers and releasing managers to debunk
	 some of the myths you may have!\nSpeaker\n:\nAmy KWAN\, Executive Directo
	r\, CBG\nPony LAU\, Senior Vice President\, GTS\nFergus LO\, Vice Presiden
	t\, PB\n \n \n \n\n\n\n___________________________________________________
	___________________________________________________________\n\nOption 1 
	– If you are joining via a laptop or mobile device through the applicati
	on:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link \n2. Use a headset for
	 a better experience\n*Visit here to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting
	 password: uyQPpZCv643 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining 
	via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Cal
	l" icon\n2. Dial 25153130291@dbs.webex.com into the search bar and press "
	Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Cli
	ck here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY \n\nOption 3 – If you are j
	oining via a laptop through the Web browser: \nFor external parties who do
	 not wish to download the application \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex 
	Meeting Link \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' 
	appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name an
	d Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick here to find out more\n\nOp
	tion 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charges /
	 Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please use e
	ither Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442\nHong K
	ong +852-3018-6828\nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114\nIndia\, Hyderabad +91
	-40-6480-0114\nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839\n\nMeeting Number: 2515 313 0291#\n
	Global call-in numbers \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Suppo
	rt Team! \n \n
DTEND;TZID="China Standard Time":20230721T120000
